/**
 * LiveATC feeds per airport, generated by probing `https://d.liveatc.net/<mount>`
 * for each airport and reading the name each stream announces (`icy-name`).
 * `mhz` lists the published frequencies each feed carries: read from the name
 * where it gives them, otherwise the positions the name points at (runways,
 * sides) or every position of that kind for a general "Tower" or "Ground" feed.
 * `alt` are other mounts announcing the same thing, tried when the first is down.
 *
 * Feeds come and go; re-probe now and then. Mounts that answered 404 are not listed.
 */
